<title>USA: Standard Pacific ups shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Standard Pacific ups shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Pacific Corp said its board of directors authorized the repurchase of an additional $10 million of common stock.</p>
<p>In July 1995, the company authorized the repurchase of $10 million of common stock, of which approximately $3.2 million currently remains available for repurchase.</p>
<p>Shares were unchanged at 8-1/4 on Monday.</p>
<p>Standard Pacific builds medium-priced single family homes with operations throughout the major metropolitan markets in California and Texas.</p>
</text>
